MATCH (n {coordinate:"M3-2-1"}) WHERE n.c_1_description = "Adenine is Old Yin: the yin nucleotide that moves, valued 6 in the coin cast. Its element is Water and its suit is Cups. As a purine with its double-ring structure, it carries greater informational complexity. Its partnership with Thymine through double hydrogen bonds creates the foundational stability of the DNA double helix while maintaining the flexibility necessary for replication and transcription." SET n.c_1_description = "Adenine stands as the primary yang nucleotide, embodying the expansive, outward-reaching force in genetic architecture. As a purine with its double-ring structure, it carries greater informational complexity. Its partnership with Thymine through double hydrogen bonds creates the foundational stability of the DNA double helix while maintaining the flexibility necessary for replication and transcription.";
