MATCH (n {coordinate:"M3-2-2"}) WHERE n.c_1_description = "Thymine is Old Yang: the yang nucleotide that moves, valued 9 in the coin cast. Its element is Fire and its suit is Wands. Its unique methylation distinguishes DNA from RNA, where uracil takes its place. As a pyrimidine with single-ring structure, it is the simpler partner of the A-T pair." SET n.c_1_description = "Thymine embodies the primary yin nucleotide, representing the contractive, inward-drawing force that complements Adenine's expansion. Its unique methylation distinguishes DNA from RNA, marking it as the stable, grounding force. As a pyrimidine with single-ring structure, it provides the receptive simplicity that balances Adenine's complex assertion.";
