MATCH (n {coordinate:"M3-2-3"}) WHERE n.c_1_description = "Cytosine is Young Yin: the yin nucleotide that rests, valued 8 in the coin cast. Its element is Earth and its suit is Pentacles. Its ability to form triple hydrogen bonds with Guanine creates regions of maximum stability in the DNA structure. Cytosine's susceptibility to methylation makes it a key player in epigenetic regulation, allowing genetic expression to be modulated without changing the underlying code." SET n.c_1_description = "Cytosine serves as the communicative nucleotide, encoding the expressive capacity of the genetic system. Its ability to form triple hydrogen bonds with Guanine creates regions of maximum stability in the DNA structure. Cytosine's susceptibility to methylation makes it a key player in epigenetic regulation, allowing genetic expression to be modulated without changing the underlying code.";
