MATCH (n {coordinate:"M3-2-4"}) WHERE n.c_1_description = "Guanine is Young Yang: the yang nucleotide that rests, valued 7 in the coin cast. Its element is Air and its suit is Swords. As a purine, it provides the complex double-ring framework of its pair. The C-G pair's triple hydrogen bonding creates regions of exceptional stability, marking areas of particular importance in the genetic structure." SET n.c_1_description = "Guanine embodies the receptive integration principle, serving as the complement to Cytosine's expression. As a purine, it provides the complex structural framework needed to receive and process genetic communication. The C-G pair's triple hydrogen bonding creates regions of exceptional stability, marking areas of particular importance in the genetic structure.";
